$ messages
signature: [--nx value] [--help] [--markdown] [--version]
usage: messages [--nx value] [--help] [--markdown] [--version]

The usage as text

Optional switches:
  --nx value
      default value 64
      Cells
  --help, -h
      Print this help message
  --markdown, -md
      Save this help message in a Markdown file
  --version, -v
      Print version
